# Grid Table Agents Index

Use these skills to keep Grid Table work consistent across library and portal.

## Skills (`.cursor/skills/`)

| Skill | When to use |
|-------|-------------|
| **grid-table-code-review** | `/grid-table-code-review`, before merge, refactoring legacy components |
| **grid-component-workflow** | New component, portal demo page, changelog entry |
| **grid-code-quality** | Types in type files, constants in const files, no magic numbers |
| **grid-release-workflow** | Version bump, CHANGELOG, build, portal, publish |

## Rules (`.cursor/rules/`)

- `code-style.mdc` — no comments, types/consts split, `import type`
- `project-structure.mdc` — folder layout for library and portal
- `portal-rules.mdc` — Bear UI only, i18n for all UI copy
- `library-rules.mdc` — headless grid patterns, context API

## Handoff

- Code review gates run on pre-commit via `npm run sanity`
- Portal demos must use real library APIs — no mock-only pages
- Every release ships `Sanity/sanity-release-{version}.md`
